Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 08:51:30 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): the Post dialog opens where the document last posted

The dialog opened with no folder and program.nc every time (#258, part
1). It now starts in the folder of the document's last successful post
with that file's name, else beside the saved project as <project>.nc,
from a pure rule the tests read (ui::post_file).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
